**DIRAC
.TITLE
 calculate selected grid function on a 3D regular grid and export it to an external h5 file
**INTEGRALS
*READIN
.UNCONTRACT
**WAVE FUNCTION
.SCF
*SCF
.CLOSED_SHELL
10
.EVCCNV
1.0D-8
**VISUAL
.REFACT
!.3D_INTEGRATE
.PRINT
1
.OUTPRI
.GRIDS    
1
id=1 input=import file_inp=grid2.h5
.GRIDFUNCTIONS    
6
name=espe id_grid=1 purpose=visualization export=yes file_out=espe.h5
